00:31:39,393 --> 00:31:44,693
眩しい素敵な人ばかりで
Surrounded by such dazzling, wonderful people,

408
00:31:44,993 --> 00:31:48,993
自信もなくて
I have no confidence at all,

409
00:31:49,193 --> 00:31:52,693
それでも本音では
but deep down in my heart...

410
00:31:52,993 --> 00:31:57,993
365日 もっと近づきたい
All 365 days, I want to get closer to you.

411
00:31:58,193 --> 00:32:03,393
私なりのペースになるけど
Even if it's at my own slow pace,

412
00:32:03,693 --> 00:32:08,693
ヒロインオーディション 勇気を出したら君は
in the heroine audition, if I muster up my courage,

413
00:32:08,993 --> 00:32:13,993
ねぇ 応えてくれるかな
hey, will you answer me?

414
00:32:14,193 --> 00:32:19,393
出会った一瞬ってかなりすごいミラクル
The moment we met was truly an amazing miracle.

415
00:32:19,693 --> 00:32:24,193
このチャンスは赤い糸
This chance is a red thread of fate.

416
00:32:24,393 --> 00:32:30,193
ギュッと手繰り寄せて 運命にしよう
Let's reel it tight and turn it into destiny.

417
00:32:30,393 --> 00:32:37,193
信じて まっすぐ せーので言葉にして
Believing straight ahead, let's say it out loud on three!

418
00:32:37,393 --> 00:32:41,693
君のヒロインは誰？
Who is your heroine?

419
00:32:44,993 --> 00:32:50,693
ぎゅっと君の心を 動かしてみせるよ
I'll definitely move your heart.

420
00:32:50,993 --> 00:32:55,993
まだまだ全然足りないけど
Even though I'm still not nearly enough,

421
00:32:56,193 --> 00:33:01,693
ヒロインオーディション 選んでそして私を
in the heroine audition, choose me, and then...

422
00:33:01,993 --> 00:33:06,693
いつかぎゅっとしてほしい
I want you to hold me tight someday.

423
00:33:06,993 --> 00:33:12,193
ありがとう ずっと大好きだよ
Thank you, I will love you forever!

424
00:33:38,193 --> 00:33:42,693
もういいじゃん むきになっちゃって格好つけて
Enough already! Getting so defensive and trying to act cool,

425
00:33:42,693 --> 00:33:47,993
格好良くない そういうの嫌になってんだ ほっといてよ 知りたくない
you're not cool at all. I'm sick of that, leave me alone, I don't wanna know.

426
00:33:48,193 --> 00:33:52,993
もういいじゃん やけになってんの 嫉妬したりじっとできない
Enough already! You're so desperate, getting jealous and unable to sit still.

427
00:33:52,993 --> 00:33:57,993
聞こえないよう耳塞いだって 言ってくるじゃん しんどいな
Even if I cover my ears so I can't hear, you still say it. How exhausting.

428
00:33:58,193 --> 00:34:04,993
僕は誰も覗かないよ だから僕のことそっとしといて
I won't pry into anyone, so just leave me alone.

429
00:34:05,193 --> 00:34:09,793
うざいだけの馬鹿にハイハイハイ ウケる「またのお越し待ってるね」だとか
Giving a "Yeah, yeah, yeah" to the annoying idiot. Hilarious, saying stuff like "Looking forward to your next visit!"

430
00:34:09,793 --> 00:34:14,393
本当は怯えてる 吠えるだけの弱虫だったった
In reality, you're just a terrified coward who does nothing but bark.

431
00:34:14,593 --> 00:34:19,193
痛くて居たいってハイハイハイ いつも意識のフリばっかなの
Crying "It hurts, but I want to stay," yeah, yeah, yeah, always just pretending to be conscious.

432
00:34:19,193 --> 00:34:24,193
僕は壁を張ったまま笑う それ以上近づかないでってって
I laugh with my barrier up: "Don't come any closer than that."

433
00:34:24,193 --> 00:34:25,693
怖いくせに
Even though you're scared.

434
00:34:25,693 --> 00:34:29,993
ばかばっか ばかばっか
Nothing but idiots, nothing but idiots.

435
00:34:30,193 --> 00:34:34,693
ばかばっか 嫌 ばかばっか
Nothing but idiots, no! Nothing but idiots.

436
00:34:37,193 --> 00:34:41,993
もういいじゃん まだ怒ってんの ほっといてよ ほっとできない
Enough already! Are you still mad? "Leave me alone." I can't leave you alone.

437
00:34:41,993 --> 00:34:46,993
見ないように目を逸らしたって ついてくるじゃん やっぱり
Even if I avert my eyes so I don't look, you follow right behind me as expected.

438
00:34:46,993 --> 00:34:51,693
転がったら起きればいいじゃん 見失ってるなら探せばいいじゃん いやいやいやいやいや それでよくない？
If you fall, just get back up! If you lost it, just search for it! No no no no no, wouldn't that be fine?

439
00:34:51,693 --> 00:34:56,993
間違ったら直せばいいじゃん 嫌になったらやめればいいじゃん いやいやいやいやいや それでよくない？
If you make a mistake, just fix it! If you get sick of it, just quit! No no no no no, wouldn't that be fine?

440
00:34:57,693 --> 00:35:00,193
僕は誰も覗か…
I won't pry into anyo—

441
00:35:00,214 --> 00:35:04,714
...わないよ だから僕のことそっとしといて
...no match for you, so just leave me alone.

442
00:35:05,114 --> 00:35:11,614
嫌なこと全部「大丈夫」だと言えたらいいのにな
I wish I could just say "it's okay" to everything I hate.

443
00:35:11,914 --> 00:35:15,714
思えたらいいのにな
I wish I could feel that way.

444
00:35:16,214 --> 00:35:21,114
機嫌を伺えたら大正解 いつも僕はそんなロールなの
Reading the room is the right move—that's always my role.

445
00:35:21,314 --> 00:35:26,014
また言いたいことを殺したから もう忘れてくれ
I've killed what I wanted to say again, so just forget it.

446
00:35:26,114 --> 00:35:27,414
うわっはっはー
Uwahaha!

447
00:35:27,614 --> 00:35:31,014
ふざけただけの馬鹿にハイハイハイ (受けるー)
Saying "Yeah, yeah, yeah" to fools just messing around (Hilarious!)

448
00:35:31,114 --> 00:35:33,814
またのお越し待ってる面汚しとか
Like a disgrace waiting for them to visit again,

449
00:35:33,814 --> 00:35:36,914
本当は怯えてる 吠えるだけの弱虫だったった
I was really just a terrified coward, all bark and no bite.

450
00:35:37,014 --> 00:35:41,714
痛いくせに咲いてハイハイハイ いつも平気なフリばっかなの
In pain yet putting on a show, "Yeah, yeah, yeah," always just pretending I'm fine.

451
00:35:41,814 --> 00:35:46,614
僕は壁を張ったまま笑う それ以上近づかないで
I smile while keeping my guard up—don't come any closer.

452
00:35:46,614 --> 00:35:47,514
どうか
Please.

453
00:35:47,614 --> 00:35:52,114
本当馬鹿ばっか いい加減ばっか とんだバグばっか だせえなって
Seriously, just idiots everywhere, so irresponsible, nothing but ridiculous bugs—how lame.

454
00:35:52,214 --> 00:35:57,014
そんな言葉吐く僕もやっぱ どうしようもない 黙ってようか
Spitting such words, I'm hopeless too—maybe I should just stay quiet.

455
00:35:57,114 --> 00:36:02,014
正解の答えなら「ないない」死ねるって 僕の口ばっかだね
If there's a correct answer, it's "none"—saying "I could die," it's all talk from me.

456
00:36:02,114 --> 00:36:06,514
今日も壁を張ったまま笑う それ以上近づかないでってって
Today again, I smile with my walls up, saying "Don't come any closer!"

457
00:36:06,614 --> 00:36:12,714
怖いじゃん 馬鹿ばっか ほら 馬鹿ばっか
Isn't it scary? Nothing but fools! Look, nothing but fools!

458
00:36:13,714 --> 00:36:21,214
[Duet with Lui-senpai♡ / いつかルイせんぱいみたいにCOOLになりたい〜!! / がんばるるね BAU BAU! Thank You♡]
[Duet with Lui-senpai♡ / I want to be cool like Lui-senpai someday~!! / I'll do my best! BAU BAU! Thank you♡]

459
00:36:29,514 --> 00:36:31,014
3, 2, 1

460
00:36:32,014 --> 00:36:36,614
Chu Chu Chu Chu...

461
00:36:36,714 --> 00:36:42,714
何気ない声が そわそわ ちょっとお粗末がいいな まだまだだけど
A casual voice makes me restless; a little clumsy is nice, though there's still a long way to go.

462
00:36:42,814 --> 00:36:48,014
いつからかそれが 眩しくなる
Sometime along the way, that became dazzling.

463
00:36:48,214 --> 00:36:51,014
Ah-ah-ah-ah

464
00:36:51,114 --> 00:36:55,414
気づいてんじゃない？ きっと甘い そんな言葉で Yeah
Aren't you noticing? Surely with such sweet words, yeah.

465
00:36:55,514 --> 00:36:56,714
Ah-ah-ah-ah

466
00:36:56,814 --> 00:37:00,814
もっとハマっちゃって ねえ 弓を射っちゃって
Fall even deeper for me—come on, shoot your bow!

467
00:37:01,014 --> 00:37:06,814
空から今 落ちてく 飛んでく 何処か 欲しく虜にして 渦巻く恋熱 解して
Falling from the sky now, flying off somewhere, making you mine and captive, unraveling this swirling fever of love.

468
00:37:07,014 --> 00:37:12,814
もう君は最低だ 叶わないな
You're truly the worst—I just can't compete.

469
00:37:13,214 --> 00:37:17,214
君のキューピッドです また夢中 Chu
I'm your Cupid, crazy about you again, chu!

470
00:37:17,214 --> 00:37:24,014
きっと夢に出てくる Chu Chu Chu Chu...
I'm sure I'll appear in your dreams, chu chu chu chu...

471
00:37:24,114 --> 00:37:26,614
痛いのよ今も
It still hurts, even now.

472
00:37:26,714 --> 00:37:32,114
きゅーきゅーです また胸ギュッとなんだかデリケート
It's squeezing tight—my heart clenches again, somehow so delicate.

473
00:37:32,214 --> 00:37:36,614
Chu Chu Chu Chu...

474
00:37:36,714 --> 00:37:40,014
ぎゅっと抱きしめて
Hold me tight.

475
00:37:52,014 --> 00:37:58,614
どうして？ Rat-ta-ta, rat-ta-ta, rat-ta-ta, rat-ta-ta
Why? Rat-ta-ta, rat-ta-ta, rat-ta-ta, rat-ta-ta

476
00:37:58,714 --> 00:38:04,814
君はまだ知らない事情 私も見えてないでしょう
Circumstances you don't yet know—I probably can't see them either, right?

477
00:38:04,914 --> 00:38:10,814
泣いちゃった 泣いちゃった 泣いちゃった 泣いちゃった
I ended up crying, crying, crying, crying.

478
00:38:10,914 --> 00:38:16,814
あの子には見せちゃう微笑 想うだけで熱上昇
Showing that smile only to them, fever rising just from thinking about it.

479
00:38:16,914 --> 00:38:22,614
会いたい衝動 その眼差し Ah
The urge to see you, that gaze, ah.

480
00:38:22,714 --> 00:38:28,814
探し続けた 宝石みたい
Like a gem I've searched for all along.

481
00:38:29,014 --> 00:38:34,914
でも まだまだ 気づくことピンチだ 浮かせる足も愛して 凍てつく鈍色愛して
But still, realizing it spells trouble—love even my restless feet, love even the frozen dull gray.

482
00:38:35,014 --> 00:38:41,014
ああ もうあたし最低だ 辞めれないから
Ah, I'm truly the worst, because I can't stop.

483
00:38:41,214 --> 00:38:45,614
君のキューピッドです また夢中 Chu
I'm your Cupid, crazy about you again, chu!

484
00:38:45,714 --> 00:38:52,914
もっと欲しくなってく Chu Chu Chu Chu...
Wanting you even more, chu chu chu chu...

485
00:38:53,014 --> 00:38:55,214
期待をしちゃうよ
I'm getting my hopes up.

486
00:38:55,214 --> 00:39:00,814
Give you love 感情流入 ずっと気持ち溢れる
Give you love, pouring emotions in, feelings overflowing endlessly.

487
00:39:01,014 --> 00:39:07,614
Chu Chu Chu Chu... ぎゅっと抱きしめて
Chu Chu Chu Chu... Hold me tight.

488
00:39:07,714 --> 00:39:18,014
ぎゅっと抱きしめて ぎゅっと...
Hold me tight, tight...

489
00:39:18,114 --> 00:39:24,114
ああ もう隠せないけど 止まらない鼓動
Ah, I can no longer hide it, this unstoppable heartbeat.

490
00:39:24,214 --> 00:39:30,014
夢から覚めて 気づいて今
Wake up from the dream and realize it now.

491
00:39:31,214 --> 00:39:39,214
[かなたせんぱい♡ / 「きゅーぴっど。」を歌ったよー!! / ずーっと忘れないよー!! / we LOVE you♡]
[Kanata-senpai♡ / We sang "Cupid."!! / We'll never forget it!! / We LOVE you♡]

492
00:39:51,714 --> 00:39:56,714
We'd run right through

493
00:39:56,914 --> 00:40:00,214
those nights, I'll never find my way back to

494
00:40:00,235 --> 00:40:02,535
...to you inside this labyrinth of lights

495
00:40:02,735 --> 00:40:05,035
There was madness in the meaning

496
00:40:05,035 --> 00:40:06,335
never laugh less

497
00:40:06,335 --> 00:40:09,335
we were screaming at the top of our lungs to the numbness

498
00:40:09,335 --> 00:40:12,535
this city never died

499
00:40:13,035 --> 00:40:18,035
I'll fly, no proof

500
00:40:18,035 --> 00:40:20,235
those heights

501
00:40:20,235 --> 00:40:23,935
I'll never find another chance to say, hey, thanks for saving my life

502
